      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi suh orjooga Israeli: Rubeni gil, ea Simeoni, ea Lawi, ea Yuda, ea Isakari, ea Sabuloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dani, ea Yosefu, ea Benjamini, ea Naftali, ea Gadi, ea Asheri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Yuda: Eri gil, ea Onani, ea Shela; orjusu asamwaguun ghaamwat geeguura Batshuwa bea eemeeda Ganaani. Hean gamunyiit Eriheeda was duweacheeda Yuda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak geabwar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Damari was gatmooda orjeedaanyi eara ada gwajiilsa niny Beresi ea Sera. Orjooga sean bea Yuda ea muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Beresi: Hesroni gil, ea Hamuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Sera: Simri gil, ea Etani, ea Hemani, ea Galkoli, ea Dara, sean ea muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Garmi: Akari gil, ghayi nung' gwasawana fuga Israeli, aba geandeayda gidaghaydit siitaw ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Etani orjeedaanyi geeguura Asariya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gumdooda fuga gheeh sugoocheanda was Dawdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga sijiilsa Hesroni: Yerameli gil, ea Ramu, ea Gelubai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaji Ramu Aminadaabu, ak gwaji Aminadaabu Nashoni was siida haweewa orjooga Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwaji Nashoni Salma ak gwaji Salma Boasi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwaji Boasi Obedi, Obedi gwaji Yese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwaji Yese Eliyabu was duweacheadaanyi, deaba iyeenya ea Abinadabu, deaba samwagu ea Shama gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deaba ang'wan ea Natanaeli, nea deaba muut ea Radayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea deaba lah ea Osemu, nea deaba ispwa ea Dawdihi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea haweega ghaamwat ea Seruya gil ea Abigaeli, nea orjooga Seruya ea Abishayi gil, ea Yoabu, ea Asaheli saawa ea samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaji Abigaeli Amasa, nea ghweanda Amasa ea Yeteri bea eemeeda Shumwaheeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Hesroni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Galebu was orjeeda Hesroni gwandeawa diibiga jih sea gatmoadaanyi siguura Asuba, ak gwaji huda siguura Yeriyoti ak gwaji orju samwagu: Yesheri, ea Shobabu, ea Ardoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata nea ghami Asuba, hean ghaghi Galebu Furati, ak gwajiilsa Huri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaji Huri Uri, ak gwaji Uri Besaleli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda mideawa Hesroni gweanyeew laadam ghaghi hudeaba Makiri was ghweanda Gileyadi. Ng'ata gwaji Hesroni gwaji Segubu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwaji Segubu Yairi, ambal mujiinaji diktam ea samwagu aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoareat fuga Geshuri ea Aramu mujiineeda Yairi, ea Genati sea gharang'weakaaschi, was mujiinaji laadam. Suh seaniin jeacheenga Makiri, was ghweanda Gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghang'ata miyeeda Hesroni, ghaghi Galebu Efrata was gatmooda ghwaan was Hesroni, ak gwajiilsa niny Ashuru, was siida ang'eat mujiineeda Dekowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga Yerameli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Yerameli, was duweacheeda Hesroni: Rama gil, was duweacheadaanyi, ea Buna, ea Oreni, ea Osemu, ea Ahiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwandeawa Yerameli gatmu nuut, siguura gheawungaaschi Atara; nea niny ea gheamata Onamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh orjooga Ramuhi was duweacheeda Yarameli: Maasi gil, ea Yamini, ea Ekari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Onamu suhu: Shamayi gil ea Jaada. Orjooga Shamayi suhu: Nadabu gil ea Abishuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gheawunga gatmooda Abishuri geeguura Abihaili, ak gwajiilsa niny Abani ea Molidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Nadabu suhu: Seledi gil ea Apaimu; ak ghami Seledi nea gwanya diy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjeeda Apaimu Ishi gil. Orjeeda Ishi: Sheshani gil. Orjeeda Sheshani: Alayi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Jaada, orjeeda geenyea Shamayi suhu: Yeteri gil ea Yonatan; ak ghami Yeteri nea gwanya diy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Yonatan suhu: Beleti gil ea Sasa. Suh jeacheenga Yerameli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Sheshani gwanya orji, geaghus haweega; nea abeeda Sheshani gwandeawa soomjeanda ng'eanyiida Misri, siguura gheawungaaschi Yarha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadaw Sheshani niny hudaanyi ghaghi Yarheeda was soomjeandaanyi; ak gwajiilsa niny Atayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaji Atayi Natani nea Natani gwaji Sabadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwaji Sabadi Eflali ak gwaji Eflali Obedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaji Obedi Yehu, ak gwaji Yehu Asariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwaji Asariya Helesi, ak gwaji Helesi Eleyasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eleyasa gwaji Sismai, ak gwaji Sismai Shalumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalumu gwaji Yekamiya ak Yekamiya gwaji Elishama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeacheenga suuk bea Galebu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Galebu was orjeeda geenyea Yerameli: Meresha gil was duweacheadaanyi, ak gwaji Sifu. Orjeeda Meresha: Hebroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Hebroni: Gora gil, ea Dapua, ea Rekemu, ea Shema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwaji Shema Rahamu, was ghweanda Yorkeyamu; nea Rekemu gwaji Shamayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea orjeeda Shamayi: ea Maoni; ak gwaji Maoni Bet-suri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eara Eefayda was gwealeeda Galebu, gwaji Harani, ea Mosa, ea Gasesi; ak gwaji Harani Gasesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak orjooga Yadai ea suhu: Regemu gil, ea Yotam, ea Geshani, ea Beleti, ea Eefa, ea Shaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Maaka was gwealeeda Galebu, gwaji Sheberi ea Dirhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaji Shaafu was ghweanda Madmana, ea Shefa was ghweanda Makbena, ea ghweanda Gibeya; nea hudeaba Galebu siguura Aksa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suh jeacheenga Galebu. Orjooga Huri was duweacheeda Furati; Shobali gwaji Giriat-yearimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salma, siida ang'eat mujiineeda Betlehemu, nea Harefu ea siida ang'eat Bet-gaderi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shobali siida ang'eat Giriat-yeariimu abeeda gwandeawa orju suuk: Haroyehi, ea fuga mwaatkwa bea Menuhoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Giriat-yeariimu: Itrihi, ea Buti, ea Shumati, Mishrayi; ak gwarina heedeaba fiisu fuga Sorati, ea Eshtaoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orjooga Salma Betlehemu, ea Netofati, ea Atrot-bet-yoabu, ea fuga mwaatkwa Menuhoti, ea Sori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sea fuga ng'oorshachi abiita Yabesi: Fuga Dirati, ea Shimeyati, ea Sukati. Suh fuga Geni leabu heeda Hamati, was ghweanda dooshta Rekabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:55",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Rekabu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Salma nih Salmoni.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
